  <para style="h">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malaki</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 1:1" />Iri ni ijambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarungikiye Abisirayeli, arivugishije Malaki.<verse eid="MAL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urukundo Imana ikunda Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 1:2" />“Narabakunze,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:2">“Ariko murabaza muti: ‘Wadukunze gute?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:2">“Mbega Esawu ntiyavukana na Yakobo?” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza. “Ariko nakunze Yakobo, <verse eid="MAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 1:3" />Esawu we ndamwanka, imisozi yiwe ndayigira agahinga, itongo ryiwe ndariha imbwebwe zo mu bugaragwa.”<verse eid="MAL 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 1:4" />Abanyedomu boshobora kuvuga bati: “Naho twahonejwe, tuzosubira twubake ku misaka.” Ariko uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Naho bokwubaka, nzosambura. Igihugu cabo kizokwitwa igihugu c’inkozi z’ibibi, ubwoko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yama arakiye ibihe vyose.<verse eid="MAL 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 1:5" />Muzobirabisha amaso yanyu, maze muvuge muti: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arahambaye, ububasha bwiwe burenga n’imbibe za Isirayeli.’<verse eid="MAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukuva mw’isezerano mu gutanga ibimazi bitabereye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 1:6" />Umwana yubaha umuvyeyi, umukozi akubaha shebuja. Nimba ndi umuvyeyi, icubahiro canje kiri hehe? Nimba ndi shobuja, ukunyubaha kwanyu kuri he?” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose abaza. “Yemwe baherezi, ni mwebwe mutukisha izina ryanje. Ariko murabaza muti: ‘Twatukishije izina ryawe gute?’<verse eid="MAL 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 1:7" />Mwaritukishije mu gushikana ku gicaniro canje ibimazi bihumanye. Ariko mukabaza muti: ‘Twahumanije dute ibimazi?’ Mwabihumanije mu kuvuga muti: ‘Igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nta gaciro kigira.’<verse eid="MAL 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 1:8" />Iyo mushikanye ibitungwa bihumye nk’ibimazi, mbega ntimuba mukoze nabi? Iyo mushikanye ibicumbagira n’ibigwaye, ntimuba mugize nabi? Mbega mwobishikanira umutware wanyu yobashimira? Mbega yobibakirira?” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose abaza.<verse eid="MAL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 1:9" />“Ehe nimwinginge Imana ibagirire ubuntu. Ariko mbega yobemera mushikanye ibimazi bimeze bityo?” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose abaza.<verse eid="MAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 1:10" />“Vyoba vyiza hagize umwe wo muri mwebwe yugara imiryango y’Ingoro, kugira ngo ntihagire imicanwa icanirwa ubusa ku bicaniro vyanje, kuko sindabanezererewe. Sinzokwakira ibimazi vyanyu,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze. <verse eid="MAL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 1:11" />“Izina ryanje rizoba rurangiranwa mu makungu, kuva mu buseruko kugeza mu burengero. Mu mihingo yose bazonshikanira ibimota neza, n’ishikanwa ryejejwe, kuko izina ryanje rizoba ryabaye rurangiranwa mu makungu,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="MAL 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 1:12" />“Ariko mwararihumanije aho mwavuga muti: ‘Imeza y’Umwami iranduye, n’ivyokurya vyayo biragayitse.’ <verse eid="MAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 1:13" />Murongera muravuga muti: ‘Gukorera Imana ni umuruho!’ bituma mukura imitima yanyu ku mabwirizwa yanje,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze. “Iyo mushikanye ibikoko bikomeretse, canke bicumbagira, canke bigwaye, mukabitanga nk’ibimazi, mbega novyakira mu maboko yanyu?” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose abaza.<verse eid="MAL 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 1:14" />“Haravumwe umuntu afise impfizi y’intama itagira akanenge yo mu mukuku agasezerana kuyitanga, ariko akiba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu kumushikanira ikimazi kitabereye. Ndi Umwami ahambaye, kandi izina ryanje rikwiye kwubahwa mu mahanga yose!” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="MAL 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAL 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ukugabisha Abaherezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 2:1" />“None rero yemwe baherezi, iki ni co cagezwe ndabahaye. <verse eid="MAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 2:2" />Nimutanyumvira ngo mushire imitima yanyu ku kwubaha izina ryanje, nzobarungikira umuvumo, mvume n’imigisha mwahawe. Mbere naramaze no kuyivuma, kuko mutashize imitima yanyu ku kwubaha izina ryanje,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="MAL 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 2:3" />“Nzohana uruvyaro rwanyu kubera mwebwe; nzobatera mu maso amayezi y’ibimazi vyo ku misi mikuru yanyu, hanyuma ndayabatane. <verse eid="MAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 2:4" />Hanyuma muzoteba mumenye ko ari jewe nabahaye iki cagezwe, kugira ngo isezerano nagiranye na Lewi rize ryameho,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze. <verse eid="MAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 2:5" />“Isezerano ryanje ryari kuri we, kandi ryari isezerano rizana ubuzima bwiza n’amahoro, iryo ni ryo nabahaye; naribahaye kugira ngo banyubahe, ngire igitinyiro kuri bo, kandi baranyubaha cane bagahindira agashitsi izina ryanje. <verse eid="MAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 2:6" />Inyigisho z’ukuri zama mu kanwa kabo, kandi iminwa yabo yazira ikinyoma. Bagendanye nanje mu mahoro no mu bugororotsi, kandi bakuye benshi mu vyaha.<verse eid="MAL 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 2:7" />Kuko iminwa y’umuherezi ikwiye kuzigama ukumenya Imana, kandi akanwa kiwe ni ko kabarizwamwo ivyagezwe, kuko umuherezi ari intumwa y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose. <verse eid="MAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 2:8" />Ariko mwebwe mwarantaye, inyigisho zanyu zicika izigwisha abantu mu vyaha. Mwavuye mw’isezerano rya Lewi,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze. <verse eid="MAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 2:9" />“Ni co catumye nemera ko musuzugurwa, mukagawa n’amoko yose, kuko mutagendeye mu nzira zanje, ahubwo mugahengama ku bijanye n’amabwirizwa yanje.”<verse eid="MAL 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukuva mw’isezerano mu kwahukana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 2:10" />Mbega twese ntidusangiye Data? Mbega twese ntitwaremwe n’Imana imwe? None ni kuki duhemukiranira, tukava mw’isezerano rya ba sogokuruza?<verse eid="MAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 2:11" />Yuda yarampemukiye, kandi igisesema cakorewe muri Isirayeli n’i Yerusalemu. Abayuda bahumanije Ingoro <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akunda, mu kurongora abagore basenga ibigirwamana. <verse eid="MAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 2:12" />Nk’umuntu akora ivyo, uwo ari we wese, akwiye gucibwa mw’ihema rya Yakobo, naho yoba ashikanira amashikanwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose.<verse eid="MAL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 2:13" />Hari ikindi kibi mukora: mwuzuza amarira yanyu ku gicaniro, mukarira muboroga kubera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atakiraba ryiza amashikanwa yanyu, canke ngo ayakire ayakunze avuye mu biganza vyanyu. <verse eid="MAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 2:14" />Mukibaza muti: “Ni kubera iki?” Reka ndababwire igituma: ni kubera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari icabona igihe mwasezerana n’abagore banyu mukagirirana indahiro n’abagore bo mu busore bwanyu. Mwarabahemukiye, kandi ari bo mwafatanye ngo babe abagore banyu b’isezerano.<verse eid="MAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 2:15" />Mbega Imana ntiyari yabagize umwe n’abagore banyu? Mu mpwemu no mu mubiri muri abiwe. Kandi ico abipfuzako ni iki? Ashaka ko muvyara abana bamwubaha. Nuko rero nimwirinde mugume mw’isezerano mwagiranye n’abagore bo mu buto bwanyu.<verse eid="MAL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 2:16" />“Kuko ndanka ukwahukana,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze, “kandi nanka n’umuntu yitwikira umuryano nk’uko yitwikirira umutamana,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 2:16">None rero nimurinde imitima yanyu, mwoye guhemukira abagore banyu.<verse eid="MAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukuva mw’isezerano kubera akarenganyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 2:17" />Mwararuhishije <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu majambo yanyu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 2:17">Ariko murabaza muti: “Twamuruhishije dute?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 2:17">Muvuga muti: “Ibibi vyose ni vyiza mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kandi arabinezererwa,” canke mukavuga muti: “Mbega iyo Mana ica izibereye iri hehe?”<verse eid="MAL 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 3:1" />“Ehe raba ngira ntume intumwa yanje imbere, kugira ngo integurire inzira. Maze ako kanya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> muriko murarondera azoheza aze mu Ngoro yiwe, umuvugishwa w’isezerano, uwo mwipfuje, agiye kuza,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="MAL 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 3:2" />Ariko none ni nde azokwihanganira umusi w’ukuza kwiwe? Ni nde azoshobora guhagarara imbere yiwe niyaseruka? Kuko azoba ameze nk’umuriro w’umucuzi, canke nk’isabune y’uwumesura impuzu. <verse eid="MAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 3:3" />Azokwicara nk’uwutyorora ifeza, yeze Abalewi nk’uwukura imyanda ku nzahabu n’ifeza. Uko ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokwironkera abamushikanira mu bugororotsi ibimazi vyemerwa mu nyonga ziwe, <verse eid="MAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 3:4" />kandi ibimazi vy’Abayuda n’ivy’ab’i Yerusalemu bizosubira vyemerwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nk’uko yavyemera mu gihe caheze.<verse eid="MAL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 3:5" />“Maze ico gihe nzobacira urubanza. Nzihutira kwagiriza abarozi, abasambanyi hamwe n’ababeshi, abagunga abakozi impembo zabo, abacinyiza abapfakazi, n’impfuvyi, bakabuza inyambukira gutunganirizwa, kandi ntibantinye,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="MAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukuva mw’isezerano mu kudatanga ibigiracumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 3:6" />“Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kandi simpindagurika. Ni co gutuma mwebwe urvyaro rwa Yakobo mutararandurwa. <verse eid="MAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 3:7" />Uhereye kuva kuri ba sogokuruza, mwamye muta ivyagezwe vyanje, ntimubigenderemwo. Ehe nimungarukeko, nanje nzobagarukako,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 3:7">“Ariko muribaza muti: ‘Mbega twokugarukako dute kandi tutigeze tukuvako?’<verse eid="MAL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 3:8" />Mbega hari uwokwiba Imana? Ariko mwebwe mwaranyivye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 3:8">Kandi muribaza muti: ‘Twakwivye gute?’ Mwanyivye ibigiracumi n’amashikanwa.<verse eid="MAL 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 3:9" />Muri musi y’umuvumo mwe n’ihanga ryanyu ryose, kuko munyiba. <verse eid="MAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 3:10" />Nimuzane ikigiracumi gikwiye mu bubiko bwanje, kugira ngo mu nzu yanje habemwo ivyokurya. Ehe nimubingeragereshe, jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, murabe ko ntugurura imiryango yo mw’ijuru, nkabacuncuburirako imigisha mukabura n’aho muyikwiza. <verse eid="MAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 3:11" />Nzozitira inzige n’ingwara ntibitere imirima yanyu, kandi inzabibu zanyu ntizizohunguruka ziteze,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze. <verse eid="MAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 3:12" />“Ni ho amahanga yose azobita abahirwe, kuko muzoba igihugu kimpimbara,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="MAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubwibone bwa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 3:13" />“Mwamvuzeko amajambo mabi,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. “Ariko murabaza muti: ‘Ni igiki twakuvuzeko kibi?’<verse eid="MAL 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 3:14" />Mwavuze muti: ‘Gukorera Imana nta kamaro bifise. Mbega gukurikiza ivyo idutegeka no mu kwama tuza imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose tumeze nk’abagandaye, bitumariye iki?’ <verse eid="MAL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 3:15" />Muravuga ngo kuva ubu rero tuzovuga ko abishira hejuru ari bo bahiriwe, ko inkozi z’ibibi ari zo zitera imbere, kandi ko bagerageza Imana ariko ntibagire ico baba.”<verse eid="MAL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amasigarira y’abizigirwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 3:16" />Maze abubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> baraganira, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> na we yumviriza ivyo bavuga. Igitabu c’icibutso gica candikirwa imbere yiwe, candikwamwo amazina y’abo bose bubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bagahesha icubahiro izina ryiwe.<verse eid="MAL 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 3:17" />“Kuri wa musi, nzocirako imanza,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze, “bazoba ari ubutunzi niharije kandi budasanzwe. Nzobazigamira mu mbabazi zanje nk’uko umuvyeyi agirira impuhwe akazigama umwana wiwe amwubaha. <verse eid="MAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAL 3:18" />Kandi muzobona ubudasa hagati y’abagororotsi n’abanyakibi, no hagati y’abakorera Imana n’abatayikorera,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="MAL 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAL 4" />
  <para style="s1">Urubanza n’ugusezerana gushasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 4:1" />“Nta nkeka uwo musi uraje, kandi uje waka nk’itanure. Abibona n’inkozi z’ibibi bazoba nk’ubwatsi bwumye, kandi uwo musi uje uzobatongora,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze. “Nta kimeze nk’umuzi canke ishami kizosigara kuri bo. <verse eid="MAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 4:2" />Ariko mwebwe muhindira agashitsi imbere y’izina ryanje, izuba ry’ubugororotsi rizobarasira, rifise ugukiza mu mishwarara yaryo. Maze muzosohoka mwishire mwizane, mutamba mwiginagura nk’uko inyana ziginagura iyo zisohowe ziva mu ruhongore. <verse eid="MAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 4:3" />Kandi ku musi nzokorerako ivyo, muzohonyanga inkozi z’ibibi, babe nk’umukungugu musi y’ibirenge vyanyu,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="MAL 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 4:4" />Nimwibuke Ivyagezwe vy’umusavyi wanje Mose, amabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe namugereye i Horebu kubw’Abisirayeli bose.<verse eid="MAL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 4:5" />“Raba nzobarungikira Eliya uwuvugishwa n’Imana, imbere y’uko uwo musi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uteye ubwoba ushika. <verse eid="MAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 4:6" />Ubutumwa bwiwe buzosubiza imitima y’abavyeyi ku bana babo, n’imitima y’abana ku bavyeyi babo. Ahandi ho nzoza ndanduze isi umuvumo.”<verse eid="MAL 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 4" />
</usx>